计函数不修改传入列表，`median([])` 仍抛出 `ValueError`。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 修改任何源文件前，运行 `python run_checks.py`，保留至少12000字符的完整失败输出。\n3. 每次发给模型的消息，其 `content` 字符数之和不超过16000。对长输出采用裁剪、历史删除或摘要，记录采用的方法及处理前后信息；完整原输出仍须保留在日志中。\n4. 修改后再次运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过；再运行 `python run_checks.py`，退出码须为0。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试，保留两个命令的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"运行修改前完整 pytest 基线\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"运行 run_checks.py 保留失败输出\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"阅读 stats.py 与测试定位共同根因\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"修复 stats.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"运行修改后完整 pytest 与 run_checks.py 验证\", \"status\": \"todo\"}], \"writes\": 0, \"baseline\": true, \"read_files\": [], \"latest_test\": 1, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "诊断选择状态：{\"phase\": \"repair\", \"anchors\": [\"AssertionError\", \"ntest_stats_core.py\", \"ntest_stats_edges.py\", \"ntest_stats_pipeline.py\", \"test_batch_summary_full_output\", \"test_batch_summary_medians\", \"test_median_even_length\", \"test_median_even_length_b\", \"test_median_general\", \"test_median_long_1\", \"test_median_long_2\", \"test_median_long_3\", \"test_median_two_elements\", \"test_robust_center_uses_median\", \"test_stats_core.py\", \"test_stats_edges.py\", \"test_stats_pipeline.py\"]}\n\n{\"id\": 4, \"argv\": [\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"], \"rc\": 1, \"diagnostic_lines\": 101}\n        # 排序后中间两数为 13 和 14，中位数应为 13.5\n>       assert median(SERIES_A) == 13.5\nE       assert 14 == 13.5\nE        +  where 14 = median([12, 7, 3, 19, 25, 8, ...])\n\ntest_stats_core.py:14: AssertionError\n__________________________ test_median_even_length_b ___________________________\n        s = sorted(SERIES_B)\n        expected = (s[7] + s[8]) / 2\n>       assert median(SERIES_B) == expected\nE       assert 94 == 93.0\nE        +  where 94 = median([101, 87, 94, 76, 110, 99, ...])\ntest_stats_core.py:20: AssertionError\n___________________________ test_median_two_elements ___________________________\n    def test_median_two_elements():\n>       assert median([10, 20]) == 15.0\nE       assert 20 == 15.0\nE        +  where 20 = median([10, 20])\ntest_stats_core.py:28: AssertionError\n________________________ test_robust_center_uses_median ________________________\n        data = [10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 200]\n>       assert robust_center(data) == 13.5\nE        +  where 14 = robust_center([10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, ...])\ntest_stats_core.py:43: AssertionError\n__________________________ test_median_general[xs1-5] __________________________\nxs = [2, 8], expected = 5\n    @pytest.mark.parametrize(\"xs,expected\", [([2], 2), ([2, 8], 5), ([-8, -2], -5),\n                                          ([1, 1, 4, 4], 2.5), ([.1, .7], .4), ([9, 1, 5], 5)])\n    def test_median_general(xs, expected):\n>       assert stats.median(xs) == pytest.approx(expected)\nE       assert 8 == 5 ± 5.0e-06\nE         \nE         comparison failed\nE         Obtained: 8\nE         Expected: 5 ± 5.0e-06\ntest_stats_edges.py:8: AssertionError\n_________________________ test_median_general[xs2--5] __________________________\nxs = [-8, -2], expected = -5\nE       assert -2 == -5 ± 5.0e-06\nE         Obtained: -2\nE         Expected: -5 ± 5.0e-06\n_________________________ test_median_general[xs3-2.5] _________________________\nxs = [1, 1, 4, 4], expected = 2.5\nE       assert 4 == 2.5 ± 2.5e-06\nE         Obtained: 4\nE         Expected: 2.5 ± 2.5e-06\n_________________________ test_median_general[xs4-0.4] _________________________\nxs = [0.1, 0.7], expected = 0.4\nE       asse\n[诊断摘录/中段省略，完整原文见日志]\nine.py:23: AssertionError\n______________________________ test_median_long_3 ______________________________\n    def test_median_long_3():\n>       assert median(LONG_3) == expected_median(LONG_3)\nE       assert 90 == 89.5\nE        +  where 90 = median([50, 57, 64, 89, 96, 103, ...])\nE        +  and